asset:        zoom-cut.kinds.json
title:        Zoom-cut transition kinds (kick, blur-settle, push-in, into-window, twos-card, twos-push, zoom-through, whip, whip-pan, zoom-out-through, punch, flash, white-flash): the numbers behind Animation ▸ Transitions ▸ Zoom Cut (transition.apply)
author:       Elias (eliasx45)
source:       original work (copied from Elias's motion-kit repo, shelf/transitions/zoom-cut.kinds.json, commit ba541a3, sha256 d9f0f8f47188a5c5…)
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0
added:        2026-11-04 by eliasx45 (Claude Code agent, ZC1; whip-pan 2026-11-05, ZC5)
notes:        Plain data: key times, values, ease names and effect settings Elias measured on published editors' cuts (timings and scales only, no footage or artwork) and approved on 4 Nov 2026 (whip-pan: Elias's native rebuild of the HyperFrames keyframes demo 05 Whip pan, approved on 5 Nov 2026). The source of truth is motion-kit's shelf table; this is a copy, read by crates/engine/src/commands/transition.rs with include_str!. Re-copy it (cp ~/Developer/motion-kit/shelf/transitions/zoom-cut.kinds.json here) whenever the shelf table changes; never edit it here.
When re-copying, replace the local path prefix ".../The Vault/" with "The Vault/" (this repo is public; the paths are only labels).
